A: it fails to cover recent advances in seed science.
B: the content is irrelevant for them.
C: its focus is very theoretical.
answer: C
loc: lots about the theory
exp: Emma thấy sách khó theo dõi vì quá nhiều lý thuyết, Jack cũng mong điều gì thực tế hơn.
[Q]
text: What does Jack say about the article on seed germination by Lee Hall?
A: The diagrams of plant development are useful.
B: The analysis of seed germination statistics is thorough.
C: The findings on seed germination after fires are surprising.
answer: B
loc: His analysis of figures comparing the times of the fires
exp: Jack khen phân tích số liệu rất chi tiết và ấn tượng; sơ đồ thì nằm ở bài báo khác.

